Recognize AdaptiveCpp generic-flow CUDA interoperability and add a GPU runtime control.

The generic compiler exposes SYCL_EXT_ACPP_BACKEND_CUDA without enabling
Clang's CUDA language frontend. Preserve the native CUDA stream path for
that supported backend. The control checks GPU kernel execution and native
queue extraction; it refuses a CPU fallback.

Reference: https://github.com/AdaptiveCpp/AdaptiveCpp/blob/v25.10.0/include/hipSYCL/sycl/backend.hpp
